  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together ssamjang, soy sauce, brown sugar, garlic, ginger, smoked paprika, lemon juice, and olive oil.",
    "Add the cod pieces to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated cod onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Season the cod with salt and black pepper.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, or until the cod is cooked through and flakes easily with a fork.",
    "Serve the skewers in a copper mug, garnished with chopped green onions and a side of steamed vegetables."
